repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-02-23T13:52:24Z","updated_at":"2022-02-23T13:52:24Z","body":"I don't think that in principle, a single concurrent connection is going to be a problem for our use case. Any delays because of this are unlikely to be significant for small-ish sites. And if it becomes a problem, the site can always switch to PostgreSQL.\r\n\r\nMaybe we could somehow measure connection contention and expose it as a metric? But that should probably be a separate story, and it may not be worth the effort.\r\n\r\nI'm not concerned about the library being official or not. If it becomes unmaintained later, we can deal with that then. \r\n\r\nGetting rid of CGO is really nice and will speed up builds etc!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/1048803520/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"cure","id":149135,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTEzNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149135?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure","html_url":"https://github.com/cure","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"ht